flowchart LR
  subgraph P[Primary region]
    LB[Load balancer] --> A1[API replica A]
    LB --> A2[API replica B]
    A1 --> DBP[(PostGIS primary)]
    A2 --> DBP
    DBP --> DBS[(PostGIS standby)]
    A1 --> OBJ[(Versioned evidence store)]
    W[Inference worker shards] --> DBP
    MON[Monitoring and audit] --> LB
    MON --> W
    MON --> DBP
  end
  DBP -. WAL / backup .-> DRDB[(DR database)]
  OBJ -. replication / manifest .-> DROB[(DR object store)]
  P -. region loss / approved promotion .-> DR[Secondary DR region]
  DR --> DRDB
  DR --> DROB
